  "headline": "Jakarta Selatan Deploys 50 Personnel To Handle Pejaten Timur Landslide",
  "seoTitle": "Secondary Landslides Hit Pejaten Timur In Pasar Minggu",
  "metaDescription": "The Jakarta Selatan administration has deployed 50 joint personnel to address recurring landslides and infrastructure damage in Pejaten Timur, Pasar Minggu.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Jakarta Selatan municipal administration deployed 50 joint personnel to manage the site following repeated landslides in Pejaten Timur.",
    "Recent heavy rainfall triggered secondary landslides that disconnected Jalan Langgar II and caused the Poltangan waterway to overflow into residential areas.",
    "The Jakarta provincial government is accelerating the construction of a permanent retaining wall to address the ongoing instability in the region."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following a series of landslides in Pejaten Timur, Pasar Minggu, the Jakarta Selatan administration has deployed 50 joint personnel to manage the emergency response. The situation escalated after repeated landslides triggered by heavy rainfall caused severe infrastructure damage, including the severance of Jalan Langgar II. The geological instability has obstructed the Poltangan waterway, leading to flooding in local residential sectors and forcing some residents to evacuate to temporary shelters like nearby prayer halls. In response to these recurring events, the Jakarta provincial government has announced plans to expedite the installation of a permanent retaining wall. Efforts are currently focused on clearing debris and stabilizing the area to prevent further damage to local homes and public access routes, as authorities coordinate resources to mitigate the impact on the affected community.",
